  entries:
  - Id: 10
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: "Duman alg\u0131land\u0131"
      TurkishBody: "Alan\u0131 kontrol edin ve g\xFCvenlik talimatlar\u0131n\u0131
        uygulay\u0131n."
      EnglishTitle: Smoke detected
      EnglishBody: Check the area and follow safety instructions.
    Voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7700df6ac45f878438502b0e29521b07, type: 2}
  - Id: 309
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: "Egil\t"
      TurkishBody: "Dumandan daha az etkilenmek i\xE7in egilmeniz gerekli"
      EnglishTitle: CrouchInSmoke
      EnglishBody: Assign audio clip and edit this text in the content database.
    Voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1b683bcafd54ec449bd1539fc96a87ff, type: 2}
  - Id: 13
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: Tahliye
      TurkishBody: "En yak\u0131n g\xFCvenli \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0131 kullanarak
        alan\u0131 terk edin."
      EnglishTitle: Evacuate
      EnglishBody: Leave the area using the nearest safe exit.
    Voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a3fd4b27fb814f6bbd8ae889e763dde7, type: 2}
  - Id: 14
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: DoNotUseElevator
      TurkishBody: "Ses dosyas\u0131n\u0131 atay\u0131p bu metni content database
