  - Id: 103
    Popup:
      TurkishTitle: "Alarm\u0131 \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n"
      TurkishBody: "Di\u011Fer i\u015Flemlerden \xF6nce yang\u0131n alarm\u0131n\u0131
